# 📄 Documentation

This folder contains all the comprehensive documentation for the IoT-Based Predictive Maintenance System FYP project.

## 📋 Files in This Directory

- **FYP_Report.md** - Complete technical report (to be added)
- **project_proposal.pdf** - Initial project proposal
- **system_design.md** - Detailed system architecture and design
- **data_collection_procedure.md** - Step-by-step experimental procedure
- **results_analysis.md** - Comprehensive analysis of findings
- **user_manual.md** - How to use the system

## 📚 How to Use

1. Start with **FYP_Report.md** for complete overview
2. Review **system_design.md** for technical architecture
3. Follow **data_collection_procedure.md** to replicate experiments
4. Check **results_analysis.md** for detailed findings

